h you can climb before the timer catches up to you. And to everyone who’s been following along since the demo dropped in August, thank you so much for the support! Having the game featured in Next Fest alongside so many incredible indie titles is a massive milestone.It's","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T00:00:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688338","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4699370-1840310314344727","game_id":"steam-4699370","kind":"update","title":"Demo Content Update!","summary":"What an amazing first week!Seeing people jump into the demo has been incredible. Every download, every run, every piece of feedback, and every new wishlist genuinely means a lot to me.One thing that really made me smile was noticing that one player spent over two hours straight playing the demo. For a game I've spent so long building, seeing someone get that invested is an amazing feeling. I hope you're still climbing the board!Thank You for the WishlistsSince the demo launched, I've also seen a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T11:40:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314344727","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4699370-1839676055890443","game_id":"steam-4699370","kind":"announcement","title":"The Crown Tactics Demo is Live!","summary":"Today is a huge milestone for Crown Tactics - the demo is officially live on Steam!If you've been following the game, thank you for all the support so far. And if this is your first time hearing about it, welcome! This is your chance to jump into the world of fast-paced roguelike chess and see how far you can climb.What You'll Find in the DemoThe demo gives you a taste of what Crown Tactics is all about:Race up an endlessly scrolling chessboard before the clock runs out.Switch between powerful c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-01T10:17:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055890443","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4699370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:24Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:24Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4699370":"2026-10-26T13:38:24Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4699370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:24Z"},"4993150":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:24Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4699370","app_id":4699370,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:48Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"ff56e0db92a116cfb9bb190503c62a71030a3f9b10f0176b3b3806bcb4f0beaf","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Race up an endless chessboard against a ticking clock. Capture pieces, earn upgrades, and deploy powerful units to extend your climb.","publishers":[{"name":"OfficeLabs Studios"}],"developers":[{"name":"OfficeLabs Studios"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Teaser Trailer - Crown Tactics","tra